// ord takes any receiver at compile time (unknown parameter, like print and
// to_string, DEC-018) and rejects a non-string at RUNTIME with the VM's
// type_name — the guard a program that smuggles an int past the checker hits,
// worded identically by the seed VM, the C backend, the zig VM and LLVM.
// EXPECT-RUNTIME-ERROR: ord expects a string, got int
fn main() {
    print(ord(42))
}
